  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5607.03 Removing Opt Out",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5607.03 Removing Opt Out. A person may request that the Department remove the opt out by writing to Department of Safety, DMV, Attn: Assistant Director, 33 Hazen Drive, Concord, NH, 03305, and including their name, date of birth, and address.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
